{
  "label": "Menambah Group",
  "category": "Scenario Studio",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Menambah Group di Canvas",
      "id": "add-group",
      "intro": "Group adalah container visual berbentuk dashed border yang membungkus beberapa condition node. Ada 3 cara membuat group di canvas: via placeholder node, via multi-select, atau via floating toolbar.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Cara 1 — Via Placeholder Node",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\nPlaceholder node (node bertanda +) bisa langsung dikonversi menjadi group:\n• Klik tombol **+** pada placeholder node\n• Pilih opsi **Add Group**\n• Placeholder otomatis berubah menjadi `rfNodeGroup` dengan label default **\\\"Group Condition\\\"**\n• Sebuah internal placeholder baru akan muncul di dalam group (siap menerima condition)\n• Sebuah outer placeholder juga ditambahkan di bawah group untuk melanjutkan flow",
          "color": "#8B5CF6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;padding:4px 0 8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#8B5CF6;box-shadow:0 0 6px #8B5CF6;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;\">Canvas — Placeholder → Group</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:200px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:#f8fafc;border:1.5px dashed #cbd5e1;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;\">+</span></div><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#94a3b8;\">placeholder</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#e2e8f0;\"></div><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#e2e8f0;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;padding:2px 0;\"><div style=\"width:1.5px;height:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#8B5CF6,#c4b5fd);\"></div><div style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8B5CF6,#7c3aed);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;letter-spacing:.04em;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(139,92,246,.35);\">+ Add Group</div><div style=\"width:1.5px;height:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#c4b5fd,#8B5CF6);\"></div></div><div style=\"width:100%;border-radius:12px;border:1.5px dashed #8B5CF6;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#faf5ff,#f5f3ff);box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(139,92,246,.12);overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:7px 12px;border-bottom:1px dashed #ddd6fe;background:rgba(139,92,246,.06);\"><div style=\"width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:2px;background:#8B5CF6;opacity:.7;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;\">Group Condition</span><div style=\"margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#ddd6fe;\"></div><div style=\"width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#ddd6fe;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"width:140px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px dashed #a78bfa;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#f5f3ff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#a78bfa;\">+</span></div><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#a78bfa;font-weight:600;\">drop condition here</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Cara 2 — Via Multi-Select Nodes",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:2}\nGroup bisa dibuat dari beberapa node yang sudah ada:\n• **Shift+Click** untuk memilih 2 atau lebih condition node\n• **Klik kanan** → pilih **\\\"Group N nodes\\\"`**\n• Atau gunakan floating toolbar yang muncul di atas selection → **\\\"Group Selected Node\\\"**\n• Semua node yang dipilih akan dibungkus dalam satu group baru\n• Catatan: semua node yang dipilih harus berada di level hierarki yang sama (tidak boleh mixed parent)",
          "color": "#7c3aed",
          "bg": "#ede9fe",
          "previewHtml": {
            "2": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;padding:4px 0 8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#7c3aed;box-shadow:0 0 6px #7c3aed;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;\">Canvas — Multi-Select → Group</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:0;margin-bottom:0;position:relative;width:100%;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;top:-18px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);padding:3px 12px;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#2563eb);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(59,130,246,.35);\">2 nodes selected · Shift+Click</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:16px;\"><div style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:#eff6ff;border:2px solid #3b82f6;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(59,130,246,.12);\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:3px;\">C1</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af;\">AGGREGATE</div><div style=\"margin-top:4px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;\">count · 30d</div></div><div style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:#eff6ff;border:2px solid #3b82f6;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(59,130,246,.12);\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:3px;\">C2</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af;\">CONTAINS</div><div style=\"margin-top:4px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;\">blacklist</div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;padding:4px 0;\"><div style=\"width:1.5px;height:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#7c3aed,#c4b5fd);\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c3aed,#6d28d9);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(124,58,237,.35);\"><span>▣</span><span>Group 2 nodes</span></div><div style=\"width:1.5px;height:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#c4b5fd,#7c3aed);\"></div></div><div style=\"width:100%;border-radius:12px;border:1.5px dashed #7c3aed;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#faf5ff,#ede9fe);box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(124,58,237,.12);overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:7px 12px;border-bottom:1px dashed #ddd6fe;background:rgba(124,58,237,.06);\"><div style=\"width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:2px;background:#7c3aed;opacity:.7;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;\">Group Condition</span><div style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:9px;color:#a78bfa;font-weight:600;\">2 nodes</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;margin-bottom:2px;\">C1 · AGGREGATE</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;\">count · 30d</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;margin-bottom:2px;\">C2 · CONTAINS</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;\">blacklist</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Rename & Ubah Warna Group",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:3}\nSetelah group dibuat, kamu bisa mengubah tampilan via **double-click** atau **klik kanan** pada header group:\n• **Rename Group** — Buka modal dengan TextInput, tekan Enter atau klik Rename\n• **Change Color** — 6 preset warna (Ocean Blue, Emerald Green, Amber Orange, Violet Purple, Rose Pink, Slate Gray), Random Color, atau Color Picker (native browser picker)\n• Warna group menggunakan sistem HSL hue — otomatis menyesuaikan dark/light mode",
          "color": "#0ea5e9",
          "bg": "#f0f9ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "3": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;padding:4px 0 8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#0ea5e9;box-shadow:0 0 6px #0ea5e9;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0284c7;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;\">Context Menu — Double-click / Right-click</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;\"><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:12px;border:1.5px dashed #0ea5e9;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f9ff,#e0f2fe);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(14,165,233,.1);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:7px 12px;border-bottom:1px dashed #bae6fd;background:rgba(14,165,233,.06);\"><div style=\"width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:2px;background:#0ea5e9;opacity:.7;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0284c7;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;\">My Rule Group</span><div style=\"margin-left:auto;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:#0ea5e9;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">selected</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;\"><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #bae6fd;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0284c7;margin-bottom:1px;\">C1 · GEO</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;\">distance · 50km</div></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #bae6fd;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0284c7;margin-bottom:1px;\">C2 · VPN</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;\">vpn detected</div></div></div></div><div style=\"width:160px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.1);overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;background:#f8fafc;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;\">Context Menu</span></div><div style=\"padding:4px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;\">✏️</span><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#15803d;\">Rename Group</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:2px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;\">📐</span><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#334155;\">Stack Vertically</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:2px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;\">🎨</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#334155;\">Change Color</span><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:hsl(220,70%,45%);display:inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:hsl(142,70%,45%);display:inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:hsl(38,70%,45%);display:inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:hsl(262,70%,45%);display:inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:hsl(330,70%,45%);display:inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:hsl(200,70%,45%);display:inline-block;\"></span></div></div></div><div style=\"height:1px;background:#f1f5f9;margin:4px 2px;\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:2px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;\">🔓</span><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#ea580c;\">Ungroup</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fef2f2;margin-top:2px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;\">🗑️</span><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;\">Delete Group</span></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Resize & Nested Group",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:4}\nGroup mendukung resize dan nesting:\n• **Resize** — Saat group dalam kondisi selected, drag handle di pojok kanan bawah untuk ubah ukuran (min: 240×120px)\n• **Nested Group** — Group bisa berada di dalam group lain. Buat group di dalam group dengan cara yang sama (placeholder di dalam group → Add Group)\n• **Move nodes to group** — Klik kanan pada node/selection → \\\"Move to Group\\\" → pilih target group dari daftar\n• **Remove from Group** — Klik kanan node → \\\"Remove from Group\\\" → node kembali ke canvas dengan posisi absolut",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#ecfdf5",
          "previewHtml": {
            "4": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;padding:4px 0 8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#10b981;box-shadow:0 0 6px #10b981;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#059669;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;\">Canvas — Nested Groups</span></div><div style=\"position:relative;border-radius:12px;border:1.5px dashed hsl(220,70%,45%);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eff6ff,#dbeafe);padding:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(59,130,246,.1);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:2px;background:hsl(220,70%,45%);opacity:.8;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:hsl(220,70%,45%);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;\">Outer Group</span><div style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:9px;color:hsl(220,70%,45%);font-weight:600;opacity:.7;\">resize ↔</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:stretch;\"><div style=\"padding:9px 11px;border-radius:9px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(59,130,246,.08);\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:hsl(220,70%,45%);margin-bottom:4px;\">C1</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af;\">AGGREGATE</div><div style=\"margin-top:4px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;\">count · 30d</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px dashed hsl(142,70%,45%);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);padding:9px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:2px;background:hsl(142,70%,45%);opacity:.8;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:hsl(142,70%,45%);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;\">Inner Group</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 9px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:hsl(142,70%,45%);margin-bottom:1px;\">C2 · GEO</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;\">distance · 50km</div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 9px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:hsl(142,70%,45%);margin-bottom:1px;\">C3 · VPN</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;\">vpn detected</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:6px;right:6px;width:14px;height:14px;border-right:2.5px solid hsl(220,70%,45%);border-bottom:2.5px solid hsl(220,70%,45%);border-radius:0 0 4px 0;opacity:.5;\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;\">↪</span><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#15803d;\">Move to Group</span></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;\">↩</span><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#c2410c;\">Remove from Group</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
